In Sporkhack, blessed scrolls of genocide eliminate two monsters of
the chosen class at random, biased towards eliminating the higher-
level ones. Since there are four types of L, you need two scrolls to
genocide all liches. Nearly always, the first blessed scroll will nail
arch-liches, so that may be enough (since master liches are reduced in
power), but if you want to get rid of them all, you need two scrolls.

The reason for this change was to make genocide require a bit more
thought and resources, instead of just automatic "L, h, ;" with three
scrolls. The fact that there's a few more monsters you want to
genocide in Sporkhack also contributes.


